{"id":109,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":" قُلْ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"Qul yāayyuhā l-kāfirūn","translation":"Say, ˹O Prophet,˺ “O you disbelievers"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"لَآ أَعْبُدُ مَا تَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"Lā aʿbudu mā taʿbudūn","translation":"I do not worship what you worship"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَـٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"Walā antum ʿābidūna mā aʿbud","translation":"nor do you worship what I worship"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"وَلَآ أَنَا۠ عَابِدٌ مَّا عَبَدتُّمْ","transliteration":"Walā anā ʿābidum-mā ʿabadttum","translation":"I will never worship what you worship"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَـٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"Walā antum ʿābidūna mā aʿbud","translation":"nor will you ever worship what I worship"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"لَكُمْ دِينُكُمْ وَلِىَ دِينِ","transliteration":"Lakum dīnukum waliya dīn","translation":"You have your way, and I have my Way.”"}]}